  "content": "<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2f3jmM.png\" alt=\"冬季大翻修標誌\">\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"Twitter\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" alt=\"YouTube\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/bonsaistudios\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" alt=\"Kofi\">\n        </a>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" alt=\"關於\">\n        <h4>冬季大翻修是為 MMD 2021 冬季遊戲開發挑戰賽所開發。它將為 Minecraft 的雪地生態域新增各種冬季主題的機能！</h4>\n        <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/lXrggZqaE60\"\n                title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n                allowfullscreen></iframe>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <h3>內容</h3>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5M97aUS6/images/a4f4de22f38f3bb1c6423e6c3343a7bda80a1e95.png\" alt=\"頭飾\">\n        <h5>你可以自己穿戴，或送給雪人，解鎖各種新能力！</h5>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5M97aUS6/images/5f16cd5d8370b8640d6f7e69a263e2ca46fd9a82.png\" alt=\"頭飾\">\n        <h5>雪人現在會隨機生成手臂、紐扣和臉部的組合——超過 1000 種變化！</h5>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5M97aUS6/images/90b8d119b2f9983224f88b23bec6e09907f92eaa.png\" alt=\"頭飾\">\n        <h5>牠們喜歡甜莓果 &lt;3</h5>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" alt=\"製作人員\">\n        <p><br></p>\n        <dl>\n            <dt>Josh/Joosh - 美術</dt>\n            <dt>ThatGravyBoat - 開發者</dt>\n        </dl>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" alt=\"我們的其他作品\">\n        <p><br></p>\n        <dl>\n            <dt><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/creeper-overhaul\">苦力怕大翻修</a> - 這個模組用各種生態域專屬的苦力怕類型取代了原版的苦力怕！</dt>\n            <dt><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/creatures-and-beasts\">生物與怪獸</a> - 這個模組在 Minecraft 中加入了許多驚奇的生物！</dt>\n            <dt><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/critters-and-companions\">小動物與夥伴</a> - 這個模組加入了各種友善的動物！</dt>\n        </dl>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://server.pro/?ref=joosh\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NDteLeV.png\" alt=\"Server.pro\"></a>\n    </center>\n</div>",
